############################################################
# RTAB-Map Docker benchmark harness (src/rtabmap_docker)
# Migrated in from /home/amaraly/RTAB_Docker. Only the scripts,
# launch files, configs, trajectory plots and small .tum files
# are tracked. Everything below is bulk output data.
#
# NOTE: the dataset payload deliberately stays OUTSIDE the repo
# at /home/amaraly/RTAB_Docker/ (datasets/euroc/*.mcap,
# MH_01_easy.db3, MH_01_easy.txt), so it needs no rule here.
############################################################
