# Added 2026-08-25. Bulk/regenerable only — nothing here is
# original work. Ignoring does NOT delete: every byte stays
# on disk. Paths needing judgment (patched/src, *.bak files)
# are deliberately LEFT OUT so they stay visible.
############################################################

